{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":675903,"duration_api_ms":667889,"num_turns":63,"result":"Now let me produce the final JSON response.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Created `tank_harness` crate providing a reusable deterministic scientific-regression harness. The crate exposes `HarnessRun` (seeded scenario runner with checkpoint capture, envelope assertions, and failure artifact packaging) and `Envelope` (builder for snapshot bound constraints). Failure artifacts are written to a deterministic temp path (`/tmp/tank_harness/<scenario>_seed<N>/`) containing metadata.json, checkpoints.json, assertion_summary.txt, budget_ledger.json, and trace.jsonl — all reusing the existing A2b budget ledger and A2d simulation tracer rather than inventing new formats. `TANK_E2E_VERBOSE=1` triggers full trace dumps on success. Four exemplar e2e tests across two test files demonstrate the harness end-to-end: weekly-maintenance envelope checks, determinism verification, artifact capture on strict-envelope violations, and gentle-care passing runs. Also fixed a pre-existing compilation error in tank_scenarios (missing microfauna budget fields in process_preset_to_params).\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"description\": \"Explored codebase to understand existing budget/tracing surfaces (A2b BudgetLedger, A2d SimTracer), scenario system, engine API, and test patterns across 25 integration test files.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"description\": \"Created `crates/tank_harness/` crate with Cargo.toml (depends on tank_core, tank_data, tank_scenarios, serde, serde_json) and added it to the workspace Cargo.toml.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"description\": \"Implemented `src/lib.rs` with HarnessRun (seeded scenario builder, checkpoint recording, enable_instrumentation for budget+tracing, assert_envelope, assert_snapshot, artifact writing, verbose trace dump), Envelope (builder-pattern bounds on 8 snapshot fields with check method), HarnessError, Checkpoint, AssertionFailure, and ArtifactMetadata types.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"description\": \"Fixed pre-existing compilation error in tank_scenarios: added 4 missing microfauna budget fields (assimilation_efficiency, respiration/excretion/growth fraction) to process_preset_to_params with correct default values.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"description\": \"Created `tests/e2e_medium_planted.rs` with two tests: (1) medium_planted_weekly_maintenance_envelope — 30-day fishless cycle + 8 weeks of stocked maintenance with periodic envelope assertions, (2) medium_planted_determinism — verifies same seed produces identical checkpoint JSON across two runs.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"description\": \"Created `tests/e2e_nano_neglect.rs` with two tests: (1) nano_neglect_artifacts_on_violation — overfeeds then abandons a nano tank, asserts strict envelope triggers failures, verifies all 5 artifact files are written with correct content and deterministic path, (2) nano_healthy_no_violations — gentle care with wide envelope passes cleanly.\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo clippy -D warnings (clean), cargo fmt --check (clean), and cargo test (all 4 harness tests pass, all existing tank_core and tank_scenarios tests pass).\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo clippy -p tank_harness -- -D warnings: 0 warnings, 0 errors\",\n    \"cargo fmt -p tank_harness --check: no diffs\",\n    \"cargo test -p tank_harness: 4 tests passed (medium_planted_weekly_maintenance_envelope, medium_planted_determinism, nano_neglect_artifacts_on_violation, nano_healthy_no_violations)\",\n    \"cargo test -p tank_core: all existing tests pass (no regressions from tank_scenarios fix)\",\n    \"cargo test -p tank_scenarios: 3 tests pass (compilation fix for missing microfauna fields)\",\n    \"nano_neglect_artifacts_on_violation test verifies: metadata.json, checkpoints.json, assertion_summary.txt, budget_ledger.json, trace.jsonl all exist with correct content; deterministic path = /tmp/tank_harness/nano_cycle_seed77\",\n    \"medium_planted_determinism test verifies: same seed (99) + same schedule → identical checkpoint JSON across independent runs\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"TANK_E2E_VERBOSE=1 dumps trace to stderr which may produce large output in CI; downstream beads may want to configure a file sink instead for CI artifact collection.\",\n    \"Artifact directory is not cleaned up automatically on success — long-running CI will accumulate old artifacts from prior failing runs at the same seed+scenario path. Downstream beads may want a CI job to prune /tmp/tank_harness/.\",\n    \"The microfauna budget field defaults added to tank_scenarios (0.50, 0.70, 0.10, 0.20) match ProcessParams::default() but are hardcoded — if those defaults change in tank_core, tank_scenarios must be updated in sync.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7be25aa4-582a-4c1a-ae18-fd072a5b1f42","total_cost_usd":3.5964212,"usage":{"input_tokens":1956,"cache_creation_input_tokens":100237,"cache_read_input_tokens":3763660,"output_tokens":28202,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":100237,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":810,"outputTokens":21456,"cacheReadInputTokens":1174462,"cacheCreationInputTokens":118195,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.37327995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":1956,"outputTokens":282